@title The Island

You wake up in a small boat, drifting on a calm sea. In the distance you can see an island, with a thin column of smoke rising from the trees.

Do you [[row towards the island]] or [[stay where you are]]?

[[row towards the island]]:
You row until your arms ache, and the boat scrapes onto a sandy beach.

[[stay where you are]]:
You drift for hours. The island grows smaller, and then it's gone.
